/td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹2500</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full Price List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"price-row\">\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><b>Inverter PCB Repair</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm font-bold\">₹1500</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-5 py-5 border-b border-gray-100 text-sm\"><a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"text-orange-600 underline font-bold\">Full Price List</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"/remote/\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">AC Remote</a>\n                <a href=\"/capacitor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">Capacitor</a>\n                <a href=\"/compressor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">Compressor Fix</a>\n                <a href=\"/indoor-motor\" class=\"p-3 bg-white border-2 border-orange-500 rounded text-center font-bold hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white transition shadow-sm\">Indoor Motor</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Bharuch Local Areas -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-blue-900 text-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">Bharuch Areas We Serve</h2>\n            <div class=\"mb-12\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 border-b border-blue-700 pb-2\">Residential &#038; Urban Areas</h3>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4 text-sm text-blue-200\">\n                    <span>Zadeshwar</span> <span>Bholav</span> <span>Maktampur</span> <span>Link Road</span> <span>GNFC Township</span> <span>Dahej Bypass</span>\n                    <span>Station Road</span> <span>Civil Lines</span> <span>Kasak</span> <span>Shravan Chokdi</span> <span>Sherpura</span> <span>Pritam Nagar</span>\n                    <span>Nandelav</span> <span>Umraj</span> <span>Tavra</span> <span>Gadkhol</span> <span>Jhagadia</span> <span>Ankleshwar Town</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 border-b border-blue-700 pb-2\">Industrial Belts</h3>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-sm text-blue-200\">\n                    <span>Dahej GIDC</span> <span>Bharuch GIDC</span> <span>Ankleshwar GIDC</span> <span>Panoli GIDC</span>\n                    <span>Vilayat GIDC</span> <span>Jhagadia GIDC</span> <span>Palej Industrial Estate</span> <span>Sayakha Industrial</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Bharuch FAQs -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-blue-900\">Bharuch Service FAQs</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What is the cost of split AC service in Bharuch?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A professional <b>split ac jet service</b> in Bharuch starts from ₹599. We use high-pressure pumps to ensure deep coil cleaning.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you provide AC repair in Dahej GIDC?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide specialized <b>industrial ac repair</b> and maintenance for plants and offices located in Dahej GIDC.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Can you fix central HVAC for chemical industries?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, <b>Atlas Aircon</b> provides expert <b>hvac repair services</b> for large-scale chemical industrial setups across Bharuch.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What brands do you service in Bharuch?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer <b>multi-brand ac repair</b> for Daikin, LG, Samsung, Blue Star, Voltas, Hitachi, and Carrier systems.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Is gas charging available for cassette ACs?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide <b>ac gas charging</b> for cassette, split, and window units using certified refrigerants like R32 and R410.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you offer repair for inverter PCB circuits?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Our technicians are experts in <b>inverter pcb repair</b>, ensuring your advanced AC system works efficiently without full board replacement.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How long does an industrial chiller service take?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A thorough <b>chiller maintenance</b> check takes 2 to 4 hours depending on the system complexity and capacity.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you supply anti-rust coating for AC coils?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, given Bharuch&#8217;s industrial atmosphere, we recommend <b>anti-rust coating</b> for copper pipes and coils to prevent gas leaks.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Can you repair panel ACs in Bharuch?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide dedicated <b>panel ac service</b> for electrical cabinets and server rooms in Bharuch industrial zones.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How do I schedule a home visit in Bharuch?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Simply click the <b>WhatsApp button</b> or call our Bharuch helpline at <b>+91 97272 57141</b> for a same-day visit.</p>\n        